<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112160" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φορτ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>load,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φορτίσας τὸν ὄνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Babr.
					111.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φορτία φ. τινάς</span>
			<i>load</i> them <i>with</i> burdens, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				11.46
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισσῇ δαπάνῃ φ. τὰ
			κοινά</span> Dörner <i>Erlass des Statthalters von
				Asia Paullus Fabius Persicus</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδατὶς -ίζουσα τὸν ὀφθαλμόν</span>”
				<i>encumbering,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paul.Aeg.
					6.14
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐχένα φ.</span> Aenigma Sphingis
				(ap.Sch.<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				50
			</span></i>):—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μείονα φορτίζεσθαι</span>
			<i>ship</i> the smaller part of one's wealth, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				690
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φορτιούμενος μέλι</span>
			<i>to carry away a load</i> of honey, <i><span class="en">
				Macho
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				13.582f
			</span></i>:  metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυτεύειν καὶ φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Vit.</u>
					p.33J.
				</span></i>
			—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be heavy laden,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεφορτισμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
					11.28
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nav.</u>
				45
			</span></i>.</div>
